### Portal Proveedores — pruebas manuales API
### Base: http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1) Facturas abiertas (Tesorería)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/treasury/open-bills?currencyCode=PEN&dueDateTo=2026-12-31

### 2) Subir factura UBL + OC (ajustar ruta del XML según tu máquina)
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/invoices/upload
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# purchaseOrderNumber=PO00001
# xml=@backend/src/test/resources/fixtures/sample-invoice.xml

### 3) Estado three-way matching
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/invoices/{submissionId}/match-status

### 4) Generar lote de pago
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/treasury/batches
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "paymentDate": "2026-06-22",
#   "currencyCode": "PEN",
#   "invoiceIds": [123]
# }

### 5) Descargar TXT BCP
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/treasury/batches/{batchId}/download
